# Cold-chain Logistics Dispatch Console

The app uses local JSON Lines files for shipment telemetry and audit events, Gemini for reasoning, and optional Pinecone-backed SOP search.

## Windows quick start

```powershell
py -3.11 -m venv venv
.\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
if (-not (Test-Path .env)) { Copy-Item .env.storage.example .env }
python scripts\ingest_legacy_data.py
streamlit run src\ui.py
```

In VS Code, the workspace selects `venv` and activates it in new PowerShell terminals. See [docs/instrutions.md](docs/instrutions.md) for environment variables, storage paths, and tests.
